      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has also produced before us some photographs of Pithapur area and new Rausapatna area, which show that the water logging in front of the house of late Brahmananda Panda, Advocate and other places of those areas, which are also taken on r"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "22b568e0ff6b44d2bf960d2340fb4325_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nWhen the contingency plan was produced before us on the last date and it indicated the locations where the pumps have been placed and who are the operators of those pumps."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e59cf7490f0c4af785bc3743a6877c58_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We observed that the log books are to be maintained relating to the hours of functioning of the pumps with all the attendant details."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "18fb890d11ba476284274d87cd472e34_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If the pumps were available in those areas and the operators were also there on 25.06.2024, this Court fails to understand then how there was recurrence of water logging as is evident finds from the newspaper clippings, which are produced b"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dfb0101c8f3e45929533750755a0a9e0_25",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nLearned counsel for the C.M.C. shall apprise this Court on the next date and the City Engineer shall file an affidavit relating to the functioning of the pumps on that day, i.e., 25.06.2024 and whether any person has been held accountable "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c54edb2b049845158428b337ad3ef4f5_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This Court expresses dismay at the lackadaisical manner in which the C.M.C. has responded to the agony of the citizens of the millennium city, due to water logging."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b5f7d02c9934c3f942280849d495227_27",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Put up this matter on 10th July 2024 to address the issues relating to the water logging and clearing of garbage from the drains."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "96bed764d3ab4c3c862c4f32cbc0514b_28",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Commissioner, Cuttack Municipal Corporation and the City Engineer shall remain present in this Court on the said date."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2dda74a6c35c4a368dbe70ee398836c3_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is mentioned therein that repairing work of the existing defunct Sluice Gate of Hero Honda Show Room at Professorpada is to be undertaken, two numbers of VOLVO Pumps would be installed at the spot for drainage of rain water so that water"
    },
    {
