      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nWe made a query to the D.C.P. as to what arrangement has been made to detect the violators, the procedure to realize the fine amount, how to seize the vehicles unauthorizedly parked in such notified areas, who is to seize the vehicle and w"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2ee57af0a64d4a8180be7067a805ef15_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nD.C.P. stated that all the necessary arrangements have been made and are in the process of being worked out."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a2c3d537044941dba449b421f684aa93_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nWhen we put a pertinent question to the D.C.P. as to what arrangement has been made for the public to keep their vehicles in those no parking areas in case they have some work in the notified areas, he stated that request has been made to "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99d10e1a28fb4550972a0dde3b596d66_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the media reports,\nthe Tourism 27.06.2024 Department launched an eco-friendly boat ride on Taladanda Canal to attract more visitors to Cuttack."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1398d34140bb40db8072f72532b88f73_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Huge investment has been made for such purpose."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2d6391667a16436b9e3b7cefbefa259d_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Such reports further indicate that Taladanda Boating Complex and Food Court were inaugurated on 16.09.2023 but boating services have been stopped since 10th November 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d521bac73c0043ed8a552ba3a7b6ba76_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Let the learned counsel for the State obtain instruction as to why the citizens have been deprived of such facility and whether there is any proposal to resume it and if so, when it would be restored."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff0ca84ad3a54e56bd6551412975f845_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIt is stated that wire mesh fencing was put up on both sides of Taladanda Canal so that no one could throw garbage into it."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "df6b19ab5d21400d8cad5aee4898846e_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Now, the wire mesh fencing has been damaged to a great extent."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f377634f7ae4b698ac7ed4208b0c2ab_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There was also footpath on both the side adjacent to such wire mesh fencing and it has been damaged and the beauty has been lost."
    },
